librsvg-c (2.62.6-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Version 2.62.6. Final 2.62 series release unless a serious bug
    forces a later patch.
  * Resource limits: file nesting 20, layer nesting 500 (glibc) /
    50 (musl), Cairo coordinate range, image/data: heap caps 128/64
    MiB default and 512/256 MiB with UNLIMITED.

 -- Randy Butler <oss@familybusinesssoftware.com>  Thu, 19 Nov 2026 12:00:00 -0500

librsvg-c (2.62.5-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Version 2.62.5. There is no 2.62.4 package.
  * Keep the first declaration of an entity name. A nested XInclude
    that repeats the name no longer frees the entity still in use.
  * SVG image and feImage honor image-orientation (from-image default,
    none leaves stored pixels). JPEG EXIF Orientation is applied for
    from-image. PNG, GIF, WebP, BMP, and AVIF decoders do not.

 -- Randy Butler <oss@familybusinesssoftware.com>  Tue, 17 Nov 2026 12:00:00 -0500

librsvg-c (2.62.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package of the C librsvg 2.62.3 tree.
  * Binary packages librsvg-c2, librsvg-c-common, librsvg-c-dev, and
    librsvg-c-bin replace Debian/Devuan librsvg2-* (same SONAME
    librsvg-2.so.2). Source name librsvg-c does not collide with
    GNOME/Rust librsvg2 in the archive namespace.
  * css/ is the only CSS engine; libcroco is not built or packaged.
  * Introspection disabled; gir1.2-rsvg-2.0 is not shipped.
  * librsvg-c-dev Depends include libxml2-dev, libgif-dev, libavif-dev,
    libpng-dev, libjpeg-dev, and libwebp-dev so pkg-config --cflags
    --libs librsvg-2.0 works after installing only -dev.
  * Install local debs with one apt-get install ./… transaction
    (see README.Debian); do not dpkg -i librsvg-c2 alone.

 -- Randy Butler <oss@familybusinesssoftware.com>  Thu, 20 Aug 2026 18:05:13 -0400
